The baselined gismu it pretty much official. If you don't want to  
search through it, jbovlaste will search for you. Here's the page for  
melbi:

	http://jbovlaste.lojban.org//dict/melbi

Note that "officialdata" created this word. That means it's official.  
There are also some non-official words in this dictionary. Lujvo (word  
compounds, to roughly translate) make up a lot of these non-official  
words.

To search, click on "Search Preferred Words" on the side. Then click  
on [jbovlaste] to the right of the result to see more detail.

I use jbovlaste and jbofi'e a lot for Lojban stuff.

